  Hallo LoopLayer Designs,  vielen Dank für deine Nachricht. Wir bestätigen dir hiermit den Eingang deiner Anfrage. Es wurde ein Ticket mit der Nummer #30694 erstellt.  Ein Mitarbeiter unseres Support-Teams wird sich deine Anfrage ansehen und dir so bald wie möglich (in der Regel innerhalb von 24 Stunden) persönlich antworten.  Deine ursprüngliche Nachricht an uns:  Hello Customer,

Greetings from LoopLayer Design!

Looking for a reliable embroidery digitizing partner who delivers quality, precision, and consistency at scale?

With over 22+ years of combined industry experience, LoopLayer Design helps embroidery businesses, apparel brands, print-on-demand companies, and promotional product suppliers transform artwork into high-quality, production-ready embroidery files.

Why Partner with LoopLayer Design?

•	Expert Manual Digitizing: Professionally digitized designs with attention to every stitch detail, not simply automated conversions.
•	Production-Ready Quality: Optimized stitch density, underlay, stitch direction, and sequencing for smooth embroidery execution.
•	Reliable Turnaround: Timely delivery without compromising quality.
•	Competitive Pricing: Flexible and cost-effective pricing for individual and high-volume production requirements.
•	Scalable Support: Dedicated assistance for ongoing orders and growing production demands.

Our expertise covers logos, left-chest designs, caps, jacket backs, patches, appliqué, 3D puff, and other specialized embroidery applications. We support industry-standard formats, including DST, EMB, PES, and EXP.

We would welcome the opportunity to understand your production requirements and explore how LoopLayer Design can support your embroidery digitizing operations with consistent quality and dependable service.

Are you currently working with external embroidery digitizing partners, or would you be open to an additional reliable production partner? If so, we would appreciate being connected with your partnerships, vendor onboarding, or embroidery operations team.

We look forward to the possibility of building a long-term business relationship.


Regards,

Team LoopLayer Design
Professional Embroidery Digitizing &amp; Vector Artwork Services
Email: orders@looplayerdesign.com
Website: www.looplayerdesign.com

Warm regards,
admin
